{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ואשא, איל אחד</b> — this is the kingdom of Persia." "<b>ולו קרנים</b> — Media and Persia are mighty nations." "<b>והאחת גבוהה</b> — that the kingdom of Persia is greater than the kingdom of Media, or because of Cyrus king of Persia, who was greater than Darius the Mede the elder, for at the death of Darius, Babylon returned to Cyrus, and likewise: it says 'Cyrus king of Babylon' and not 'Darius the elder king,' only one year; and concerning both of them Scripture says 'by the authority of Cyrus and Darius'; and I will further explain this."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:22.730680038Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}